=2 Walkthrough
* Get your mission from {n:Hieronymus}.
* Head out to an area controlled in the Northern Area by the Beastman Confederate and locate the correct **???** near the stronghold.
* There are 2 **???**s near the stronghold; one is for the Hawk Eye campaign operations..
